# 07 - SIMULATED PAYMENTS
# UniMarket intentionally has one credential-free payment simulation endpoint.
# It does not accept card numbers, CVV, payment tokens, PayPal tokens, bank passwords, or OTPs.
# Use the checkout response.id UUIDs, not the human-readable UM-* references.
# Access tokens expire after 15 minutes; rerun the buyer login in file 01 if needed.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@buyerToken = PASTE_BUYER_JWT_HERE
@lowOrderId = PASTE_TEXTBOOK_PENDING_ORDER_UUID_HERE
@highReleaseOrderId = PASTE_FIRST_LAPTOP_PENDING_ORDER_UUID_HERE
@highRefundOrderId = PASTE_SECOND_LAPTOP_PENDING_ORDER_UUID_HERE
@declinedPaymentId = PASTE_DECLINED_PAYMENT_UUID_HERE
@successfulPaymentId = PASTE_SUCCESSFUL_PAYMENT_UUID_HERE

### LIST SUPPORTED PAYMENT OPTIONS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/options
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### SEED DECLINED SNAPSCAN PAYMENT
# Copy this response.id into @declinedPaymentId before the detail request below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: seed-low-declined-{{lowOrderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{lowOrderId}}",
  "paymentOption": "SNAPSCAN",
  "scenario": "DECLINED"
}

### RETRY THE SAME TEXTBOOK ORDER SUCCESSFULLY THROUGH PAYFAST
# Copy this PayFast response.id into @successfulPaymentId before the detail request below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: seed-low-success-{{lowOrderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{lowOrderId}}",
  "paymentOption": "PAYFAST",
  "scenario": "SUCCESS"
}

### SEED FIRST HIGH-VALUE PAYSHAP PAYMENT
# Successful orders at or above R5000 enter HELD simulated escrow.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: seed-high-release-{{highReleaseOrderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{highReleaseOrderId}}",
  "paymentOption": "PAYSHAP",
  "scenario": "SUCCESS"
}

### SEED SECOND HIGH-VALUE VISA PAYMENT
# VISA is a simulation label only; no card credentials are submitted or stored.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Idempotency-Key: seed-high-refund-{{highRefundOrderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{highRefundOrderId}}",
  "paymentOption": "VISA",
  "scenario": "SUCCESS"
}

### LIST CUSTOMER PAYMENT ATTEMPTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### VIEW DECLINED PAYMENT ATTEMPT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{declinedPaymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### VIEW SUCCESSFUL PAYMENT ATTEMPT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{successfulPaymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json
